title: Workers' Welfare Membership Dwindles
subtitle: Our unpopularity has impaired Workers' Welfare's recruitment ability.
view-if: workers_aid > 0 and workers_spd_normalized + unemployed_spd_normalized < (workers_kpd_normalized + workers_nsdap_normalized + workers_dnvp_normalized) and time >= workers_aid_unpopularity_time
new-page: true
tags: event
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/tnoreference.png";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}
on-arrival: workers_aid_unpopularity_time = time + 6

= Workers' Aid Membership Dwindles

Unfortunately, Workers' Aid's effectiveness is dragged down by the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>'s unpopularity, as the workers aren't particularly enthusiastic about joining. [? if labor_strength >= 40: However, more dedicated union members have largely remained. ?] [? if spd_votes >= 29: Furthermore, we are unable to recruit significant amount of supporters from non-worker demographics. ?]

- @workers_aid_joever: Unfortunate.

@workers_aid_joever
on-arrival: workers_aid = Math.floor(workers_aid * 0.8) if labor_strength < 40; workers_aid = Math.floor(workers_aid * 0.9) if labor_strength >= 40;

This will continue to be a problem if our popularity continues to flag.
